<div id="A3.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Other inference tool parameters are designed to maintain consistency with the framework’s execution settings. Meanwhile, the inference configurations are tailored to match the model size (32B/72B parameters) and context length requirements, avoiding memory bottlenecks during long-sequence reasoning. These cross-parameter alignments are critical for avoiding misalignment between the model’s reasoning process and the execution environment, thereby ensuring reproducibility and stability of the <span id="A3.SS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Flash-Searcher</span> system’s performance across different task instances.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T4" class="ltx_table">
