</section>
<section id="A6.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.3 </span>Model training curves</h3>

<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide detailed training curves for the <span id="A6.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Flash-Searcher</span> when applied to the Qwen-2.5-32B-Instruct and Qwen-2.5-72B-Instruct models. These curves illustrate the evolution of key metrics throughout the training process, validating the stability and convergence properties of our approach.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A6.F9.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.25301v1/loss_curve_32b.svg" id="A6.F9.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/303;" width="476" height="303"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A6.F9.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="A6.F9.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qwen-2.5-32B.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A6.F9.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.25301v1/loss_curve_72b.svg" id="A6.F9.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/307;" width="476" height="307"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A6.F9.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="A6.F9.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qwen-2.5-72B.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A6.F9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 9</span>: </span><span id="A6.F9.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Training curves for <span id="A6.F9.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Flash-Searcher</span> models. Both models demonstrate stable convergence without signs of overfitting.</span></figcaption>
