<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.42" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.42.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">### Goal 2: Determine which recipient(s) after 1977 have nationalities tied to a country that no longer exists</span></span>
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.43" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.43.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">- Status: In Progress (functionally resolved; documentation could be tightened)</span></span>
