<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.71" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.71.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">- Wikipedia “East Germany” page confirming the GDR existed 1949–1990 and ceased to exist.</span></span>
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.72" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.72.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">- Wikipedia “Claus Peter Flor” page confirming birth in Leipzig (1953).</span></span>
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.73" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.p47.73.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#990000;">- Search snippets indicating “German Democratic Republic” is on Wikipedia’s “List of former sovereign states.”</span></span>
