</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p52" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p52.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p1.pic1.p52.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#262626;">Answer: Claus<span id="A9.p1.pic1.p52.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
